The following additions and documentation/metadata updates were made on top
of the upstream project and are NOT authored by Craft Docs Ltd.:

  business/course-content-workbench/

      A business layer adapting the base for course-content operations.
      It contains a declarative AI-capability registry, deterministic
      chapter aggregation with rule fallback for long-running tasks,
      per-task artifact isolation, and account freeze / access revocation.

      The repository README and root package description were updated to
      describe this derivative work accurately.

The business directory adds one runtime dependency of its own. No source file
under apps/ or packages/ was modified for the business-layer integration.
